{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_14","type":"agent_message","text":"The defect is concrete: the current spread order is `{...local, ...defaults}`, so defaults are written last and overwrite matching local keys. Reversing the two spreads keeps all default-only keys, then replaces only keys explicitly supplied by local configuration."}}
